OL,3,AUK in talks with EU partners to release
OL,4,Astrategic fuel reserves if needed, BBC
OL,5,Aunderstands
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritain is in talks with EU partners to
OL,8,Frelease additional strategic fuel
OL,9,Freserves, including diesel, if needed,
OL,10,Fthe BBC understands.
OL,12,FThe talks come after President Donald
OL,13,FTrump threatened to ban diesel exports
OL,14,Ffrom the US in a bid to reduce record
OL,15,Fprices at the pumps for Americans.
OL,17,FDiesel prices in the UK also hit record
OL,18,Fhighs this week and are hovering just
OL,19,Funder 200p per litre, according to
OL,20,Fmotoring organisation the RAC.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
