OL,3,AUK in talks with EU partners to release
OL,4,Astrategic fuel reserves if needed, BBC
OL,5,Aunderstands
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US is a vital supplier of diesel to
OL,8,Fthe world, exporting between 1.2 and
OL,9,F1.5 million barrels per day, with
OL,10,Fexperts warning a ban on shipments
OL,11,Fabroad could put further pressure on
OL,12,Fprices in other countries.
